# Out of scope

Do not implement unless product scope changes:

- Multi-user accounts, invites, ProjectMember admin, team permissions, role matrix
- GitLab write-back, two-way sync, webhooks, scheduled sync, MRs, commits, CI, GitLab time-tracking import
- New WorkItem statuses, custom fields, nested subtasks, dependency graph, attachments, comments workflow
- User-defined Board columns or WIP policies
- Predictive analytics, utilization scores without an agreed working calendar, financial reports from unvalidated budget
- Timesheet approval, payroll, invoicing, stopwatch, overtime, billable accounting, offline sync
- CRM pipeline, invoices, budget ledger as source of truth, project document versioning
- HR, recruitment, external IdP directory sync, multi-tenant or multi-company admin
- Custom password/2FA without a real provider; notification channels that are not integrated
- New framework or database, microservices, event bus, native mobile, external CRM/HR APIs
- SLA or capacity numbers without a measured baseline
- Dashboard notification center, portfolio forecasting, configurable dashboard builder
- Cross-company BI warehouse
